                        "language": "english",
                        "review": " Pet Squad Racing is such a masterpiece. It really captures the exact way a pet would drive, and I would not be surprised if the developer of this game was an actual mouse like the ones depicted in the game. Because the realism is just that good. Whenever I play Pet Squad Racing I am constantly bumping into objects and going off track, just like a real mouse would. This attention to detail is what really allows Pet Squad Racing to shine, it’s a crime that this game is only 2.99, it should be so much more. It’s worth so much more.\n\nOverall, I give Pet Squad Racing a 10/10.\n\nAlso, on a kind of unrelated note, this game makes my computer overheat and runs at 5 FPS for some reason?",
